		Tiles.TVTile.MapEntry: Telewizor

		Dialogue: {
			StarMerchant: {
				StarMerchantDialogue1: You have no idea how much Mud Blocks sell for abroad.
				StarMerchantDialogue2: The best trade I've ever done was when I exchanged coal for a diamond sword!
				StarMerchantDialogue3: Ni hao! Wanna trade?
				StarMerchantDialogue4: Grab your emeralds and let's trade! Oh, sorry - I forgot you all use coins here...
				StarMerchantDialogue5: Microtransactions? Never heard of that!
				StarMerchantDialogue6: Are you a huge frog lover? Try your luck in my Leaf Lottery!
				StarMerchantDialogue7: Trust me, kryptonite won't make you stronger - I tested it.
				StarMerchantDialogue8: Hello there! Wanna buy some stuff?
				StarMerchantDialogue9: Huh, this place changed a lot since my last visit - just like my stock! Check it out!
				StarMerchantDialogue10: I love this place, although I hope I'll get back to my home planet one day... Anyway, would you like to buy something?
				StarMerchantDialogue11: It's always a good time for hongbao... And some trading, of course!
				StarMerchantNoShimmerDialogue1: Hey, have you seen my blue armor? I think I lost it somewhere...
				StarMerchantShimmerDialogue1: My comfiest suit! So happy I got it back!
				StarMerchantDay1: Ahh, the sky looks so beautiful today!
				StarMerchantNight1: I bet these guys burn up in no time!
				StarMerchantNight2: If every night here looks like this I gotta get myself a rail gun!
				StarMerchantNight3: Should we look at the stars tonight?
				StarMerchantRain1: Huh, at least my robe is waterproof!
				StarMerchantRain2: This rain is a drizzle compared to the ones on Neptune!
				StarMerchantRain3: Rainworld, this the matrix!
				StarMerchantWind1: I love cold winds 'cause it tells me where to go!
				StarMerchantHat1: That hat seems weirdly familiar...
				StarMerchantBloodMoon1: What's the panic? At least the skeletons here don't ride spiders... Do they?
				StarMerchantMechanicDialogue1: I wonder if {0} have some Redstone to sell.
				StarMerchantGuideDialogue1: I gotta visit {0}, he seems like a very knowledgable guy - maybe he would help me to get back home?
				StarMerchantTravellingMerchantDialogue1: Huh? {0} is here too? Finally! A worthy opponent!
				StarMerchantZoologistDialogue1: Never ask a woman her age, a man his salary, and {0} how some of my KFC items are made...
				StarMerchantMerchantDialogue1: Turns out some folks here really enjoy my style - just look at the {0}'s wardrobe!
				StarMerchantClothierDialogue1: Looks like {0} knows a lot about clothes, but I bet he never saw pieces I got for sale!
				StarMerchantTruffleDialogue1: Ahh, {0}! They understand me like no one else... Looks like we have a lot of things in common!
			}
		}

		Emotes.StarMerchantEmote.Command: gwiezdnykupiec
	}
}
